cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "PSF: A Python Library for the Persistence-State Framework"
abstract: >
  A Python library for distinguishing temporary stop-out from permanent attrition
  in self-paced online learning. Implements the Persistence-State Framework (PSF)
  with Hidden Markov Models, Dynamic Bayesian Networks, survival analysis, and
  event history analysis.
authors:
